{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["And Malki-tzedek king of Shalem — for this reason he interrupted between 'And the king of Sodom went out' and 'And the king of Sodom said,' and in between wrote: ומלכי צדק מלך שלם הוציא לחם ויין. To teach us that Avraham spoke truth to the king of Sodom when he said to him, 'בלעדי רק אשר אכלו הנערים' — for he said 'אכלו הנערים' and did not say 'we ate,' because he ate from that of Malki-tzedek."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:44:20.746774026Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}